#: data/im.bernard.Parolu.desktop.in:2
#: data/im.bernard.Parolu.metainfo.xml.in:10
msgid "Parolu"
msgstr "Parolu"

#: data/im.bernard.Parolu.desktop.in:3
#: data/im.bernard.Parolu.metainfo.xml.in:11
#: data/im.bernard.Parolu.metainfo.xml.in:51
msgid "Read text out loud"
msgstr "Darllen testun"

#: data/im.bernard.Parolu.metainfo.xml.in:7
msgid "Walter Bernard"
msgstr "Walter Bernard"

#: data/im.bernard.Parolu.metainfo.xml.in:14
msgid ""
"Parolu allows you to generate audio from text using different voices. This "
"happens exclusively offline on your device, your text is never sent to any "
"third parties."
msgstr ""
"Mae Parolu yn eich galluogi i gynhyrchu sain o destun gan ddefnyddio "
"lleisiau gwahanol. Mae hyn yn digwydd yn gyfan gwbl all-lein ar eich dyfais, "
"ac ni anfonir eich testun at drydydd partïon byth."

#: data/im.bernard.Parolu.metainfo.xml.in:18
msgid ""
"It's built on the Piper synthesizer library and supports voices for "
"different languages including German, Italian, French, Spanish, and even "
"Esperanto!"
msgstr ""
"Mae wedi’i adeiladu ar lyfrgell synthesis lleferydd Piper ac yn cefnogi "
"lleisiau ar gyfer ieithoedd gwahanol, gan gynnwys Almaeneg, Eidaleg, "
"Ffrangeg, Sbaeneg a hyd yn oed Esperanto!"

#: data/im.bernard.Parolu.metainfo.xml.in:58
msgid "Initial release"
msgstr "Rhyddhad cyntaf"

#: src/window.py:142
msgid "Loading"
msgstr "Wrthi’n llwytho"

